Negative control for filter-scorecard.test.ts.

Renames the Verified leaf's format to one no tester claims, so the leaf falls
out of the filter renderers' scorecard altogether and is left to the generic
control for its type. Any assertion that reads WHICH entry claimed the element,
and at what rank, goes red; one that only asserts some entry claimed it, or that
counts the registry, stays green.

